{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate a high security shadowy facility that rearranges itself every time you enter! Stealth is your best friend. weapons exist, but smart tools and sneaky planning will work to your advantage too! Scout the vents, observe patrols, find the key, and reach the elevator undetected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd77 <strong>Flexible stealth system</strong> <br>Run, sneak, roll and crawl around. Learn patrol routes, avoid cameras, and master the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/c4316362583ddfcb137e6fa7eb472ea5.poster.avif?t=1761864013\" width=640 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/c4316362583ddfcb137e6fa7eb472ea5.webm?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc3 <strong>Use\u00a0Gadgets, Unlock more Gadgets!</strong><br>Use screwdrivers, toy robots, bananas, and bottles to distract, stun, or slip past guards. <br>Guns are rare. Everyone beware!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/52a6dfefcf286222eab5ce7982fe0435.poster.avif?t=1761864013\" width=640 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/52a6dfefcf286222eab5ce7982fe0435.webm?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/52a6dfefcf286222eab5ce7982fe0435.mp4?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Randomly generated layouts</strong>  <br>Hand-designed rooms are shuffled into a fresh floorplan every run, forcing new routes and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/578d3152f9eaaee8e236f91a7935dcff.poster.avif?t=1761864013\" width=640 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/578d3152f9eaaee8e236f91a7935dcff.webm?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/578d3152f9eaaee8e236f91a7935dcff.mp4?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 <strong>Ventilation system</strong> <br>Unlock ducts to peek into rooms, plan ambushes, and fast-travel \u2014 if you find the right tools!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/924cf3b7a01947ebc9928e5ed2212a82.poster.avif?t=1761864013\" width=640 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/924cf3b7a01947ebc9928e5ed2212a82.webm?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/924cf3b7a01947ebc9928e5ed2212a82.mp4?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Combo-driven creativity</strong><br>Drink water \u2192 throw bottle. Eat banana \u2192 leave peel \u2192 watch guard slip. Nearly everything has a use if you're clever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/82a8e45dcca1098db099cdd3257ac7e2.poster.avif?t=1761864013\" width=640 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/82a8e45dcca1098db099cdd3257ac7e2.webm?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/82a8e45dcca1098db099cdd3257ac7e2.mp4?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Classic infiltration loop</strong> <br>Find the key. Unlock the exit. Reach the lift. Quietly, if you can. Quickly, if you must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/ffec3382acc151294874afbbf41d131b.poster.avif?t=1761864013\" width=640 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/ffec3382acc151294874afbbf41d131b.webm?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/ffec3382acc151294874afbbf41d131b.mp4?t=1761864013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>THE LAB ISN\u2019T RIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange figures float in containment. Lights flicker where no one walks.<br>Careful \u2014 this place isn't like anything you've encountered before.<br>You could go in loud \u2014 but this place has ears.<br>Better to sneak. Better to think. Better to vanish.<br>Because if they catch you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597070/extras/1816f69ee8c097bde4a11473598be32f.poster.avif?t=